{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 13, :comments ["<b>כען דך</b> — like this one's translation: דכי." "<b>מנדה בלו והלך</b> — names for the king's taxes, and their meanings according to my reasoning: מנדה — from property; בלו — tax of the provinces; והלך — toll of those traveling the king's road." "<b>ואפתום מלכין תהנזק</b> — the king's expenditures and his revenues."], :book :ezra, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 4, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Ezra -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/ezra"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:41:53.424005957Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}